  "description": "An interactive timeline / sequencer editor node for vvvv gamma: multi-track clips, after-effects-style keyframe animation, named markers, loop regions and a sample-accurate stereo audio mixer, rendered as a VL.Skia layer. Drives downstream patches through value outputs (active clip, fade gain, colour, keyframes) and a live Audio bus.",
